# Like & Comment Features — Full Summary

---

## Functional Overview

### Like (❤️)

| Aspect | Detail |
|--------|--------|
| Who can like | Logged-in users only (OTP authenticated) |
| What can be liked | Any public cake design in the gallery |
| Behavior | Toggle — tap to like, tap again to unlike |
| One per user per design | Can't like same design twice |
| Display | Heart icon + count on design card |
| No login? | Show heart but prompt login on tap |
| Business value | Identifies popular designs per occasion/style |

### Comment (💬)

| Aspect | Detail |
|--------|--------|
| Who can comment | Logged-in users only |
| What can be commented on | Any public cake design |
| Moderation | Auto-publish + "Report" button (no pre-approval) |
| Max length | 500 characters |
| Edit/Delete | User can delete their own comment |
| Display | Comment count on card, full list in expanded/detail view |
| Business value | User sentiment, engagement, community feel |

