### API Endpoints (Medusa Backend)

| Endpoint | Method | Auth | Purpose |
|----------|--------|------|---------|
| `/store/ai-studio/designs/:id/like` | POST | ✅ Required | Toggle like (like/unlike) |
| `/store/ai-studio/designs/:id/comments` | GET | ❌ Public | Fetch comments for a design |
| `/store/ai-studio/designs/:id/comments` | POST | ✅ Required | Add a comment |
| `/store/ai-studio/designs/:id/comments/:commentId` | DELETE | ✅ Required (own only) | Delete own comment |
| `/store/ai-studio/designs/:id/report` | POST | ✅ Required | Report a design or comment |

