### API Request/Response Shapes

**Like Toggle:**
```ts
// POST /store/ai-studio/designs/:id/like
// Headers: Authorization (JWT)
// No body needed

// Response
{
  liked: true,        // or false if unliked
  likeCount: 48       // updated count
}
```

**Get Comments:**
```ts
// GET /store/ai-studio/designs/:id/comments?page=1&limit=20

// Response
{
  comments: [
    {
      id: "uuid",
      content: "This is beautiful! Would love this for my wedding",
      customerId: "cus_xxx",
      customerName: "Priya",  // first_name from Medusa customer
      createdAt: "2026-07-25T...",
      isOwn: true             // true if current user's comment
    }
  ],
  pagination: { page: 1, limit: 20, total: 5, hasMore: false }
}
```

**Add Comment:**
```ts
// POST /store/ai-studio/designs/:id/comments
// Headers: Authorization (JWT)
// Body
{ "content": "Love this design! Perfect for my daughter's birthday" }

// Response
{
  comment: {
    id: "uuid",
    content: "Love this design!...",
    customerName: "Priya",
    createdAt: "2026-07-25T...",
    isOwn: true
  },
  commentCount: 6  // updated count on design
}
```

