### Frontend Proxy Routes (Next.js)

| Frontend Route | Proxies To |
|----------------|-----------|
| `POST /api/ai-cake-studio/designs/:id/like` | `POST /store/ai-studio/designs/:id/like` |
| `GET /api/ai-cake-studio/designs/:id/comments` | `GET /store/ai-studio/designs/:id/comments` |
| `POST /api/ai-cake-studio/designs/:id/comments` | `POST /store/ai-studio/designs/:id/comments` |
| `DELETE /api/ai-cake-studio/designs/:id/comments/:commentId` | `DELETE /store/ai-studio/designs/:id/comments/:commentId` |

