## Summary

- **Like** = simple toggle, one DB insert/delete, atomic counter update
- **Comment** = text input, auto-published, user can delete own, report button for others
- **All through Medusa backend** — frontend never touches DB
- **Proxy pattern** — frontend API routes forward to Medusa with auth cookies
- **Optimistic UI** — instant feedback, backend confirms

